    {
      "@id": "urn:nabou:cite_8dd715ad8e5de8601ede1931",
      "@type": "Citation",
      "schema:name": "{\"end_char\": 19451, \"end_line\": 494, \"offset_unit\": \"UNICODE_CODE_POINTS\", \"pdf_file\": null, \"pdf_reference_base\": \"LANE_ROOT\", \"printed_page\": null, \"scan_indexes_0_based\": [], \"span_semantics\": \"EXACT_QUOTE\", \"start_char\": 19164, \"start_line\": 490}",
      "properties": {
        "source_id": "src_f5eee3a8e2764468a68f95ff570a1efb",
        "locator": "{\"end_char\": 19451, \"end_line\": 494, \"offset_unit\": \"UNICODE_CODE_POINTS\", \"pdf_file\": null, \"pdf_reference_base\": \"LANE_ROOT\", \"printed_page\": null, \"scan_indexes_0_based\": [], \"span_semantics\": \"EXACT_QUOTE\", \"start_char\": 19164, \"start_line\": 490}",
        "exact_excerpt": "  The  corsairs  not  only  scoured  the  sea,  but \noften  raided  the  coasts  of  Italy,  Spain,  and  the  various \nMediterranean  islands,  sometimes  advancing  consider- \nable distances  inland,  robbing  houses  and  villages  and \ncarrying  off  the  inhabitants  into  slavery.",
        "attribution": "stated"
      },
      "historically_verified": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:nabou:att_1a068137ce432b5ae8aabb6f%3Asnapshot%3A22fed140c19bba91ac01",
      "@type": "Attestation",
      "schema:name": "The passage mentions that corsairs operated from places such as Oran and Tlemcen, in the Mediterranean.",
      "properties": {
        "attestation_id": "att_1a068137ce432b5ae8aabb6f",
        "status": "UNREVIEWED",
        "historically_verified": false,
        "assertion_class": "SOURCE_STATEMENT",
        "source_classification": "SECONDARY_SOURCE",
        "model_review": {
          "decision": "SUPPORTED_ATTRIBUTION",
          "flag": null,
          "historical_verification": false
        }
      },
      "historically_verified": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:nabou:cite_050316564be49c882ac11a43",
      "@type": "Citation",
      "schema:name": "{\"end_char\": 12579, \"end_line\": 410, \"offset_unit\": \"UNICODE_CODE_POINTS\", \"pdf_file\": null, \"pdf_reference_base\": \"LANE_ROOT\", \"printed_page\": null, \"scan_indexes_0_based\": [], \"span_semantics\": \"EXACT_QUOTE\", \"start_char\": 12308, \"start_line\": 405}",
      "properties": {
        "source_id": "src_234b1ce8a371652275e1d9dd6b455f74",
        "locator": "{\"end_char\": 12579, \"end_line\": 410, \"offset_unit\": \"UNICODE_CODE_POINTS\", \"pdf_file\": null, \"pdf_reference_base\": \"LANE_ROOT\", \"printed_page\": null, \"scan_indexes_0_based\": [], \"span_semantics\": \"EXACT_QUOTE\", \"start_char\": 12308, \"start_line\": 405}",
        "exact_excerpt": "  From \nthese  places  the  rovers  issued  to  capture,  to  destroy, \nand  to  enslave :  in  Oran  and  Tlemcen,  in  Tenes, \nShershell,  Bougie,  Jigelli,  Bizerta,  Sfax,  Susa, \nMonastir,  Jerbah,  and  Tripoli  they  lurked  ready \nfor  the  raid  and  the  foray.",
        "attribution": "stated"
      },
      "historically_verified": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:nabou:att_a63b30158af721edc0b5dd7a%3Asnapshot%3Ab1d960247f41ebeb3bff",
